    {
      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<div style=\"position:relative;\">\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:38px 40px;margin-top:30px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#03402F;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Förklaring 1/2</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:30px;\">Du känner bara till de tre synliga sidorna av varje tärning. Varje symbol finns på exakt en sida, aldrig flera. Vrid tärning 1 ett kvarts varv i taget tills den ligger likadant som tärning 2. Då kan du jämföra. Okända sidor är tomma och kan aldrig motbevisa något.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:26px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"width:300px;height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 262 262\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"219.3,66.6 147.6,112.2 42.7,81.0 114.4,35.4\" fill=\"#dad5c7\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"219.3,181.0 147.6,226.6 147.6,112.2 219.3,66.6\" fill=\"#6c6962\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"147.6,112.2 147.6,226.6 42.7,195.4 42.7,81.0\" fill=\"#b1ada1\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"57.4,142.6 84.6,116.4 130.8,130.1 130.8,198.7 84.6,185.0\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"80.8,80.3 126.7,51.1 164.6,83.8\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"207.8,139.1 207.8,123.1 179.1,141.3 179.1,126.5 157.6,163.0 179.1,172.2 179.1,157.3\" fill=\"#15140f\"/></svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Tärning 1</div>\n    </div><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.50);\">→</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"width:300px;height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 262 262\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"42.7,81.0 114.4,35.4 219.3,66.6 147.6,112.2\" fill=\"#dad5c7\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"147.6,226.6 147.6,112.2 219.3,66.6 219.3,181.0\" fill=\"#6c6962\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"42.7,195.4 42.7,81.0 147.6,112.2 147.6,226.6\" fill=\"#b1ada1\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"168.8,85.0 120.0,90.6 73.8,76.9 116.9,49.5 163.0,63.2\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"61.6,114.1 128.7,134.0 95.1,190.4\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"206.4,170.9 160.5,200.1 160.5,184.1 177.7,173.1 177.7,111.4 189.2,104.1 189.2,165.8 206.4,154.9\" fill=\"#15140f\"/></svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Tärning 2</div>\n    </div></div>\n      \n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin:22px 0 26px;\">\n      <span style=\"width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:#056B50;\"></span><span style=\"width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.25);\"></span>\n    </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;\">Tärning 1 som den visas. Vi vrider den nu steg för steg mot tärning 2. Det är fortfarande samma tärning, bara vänd.</div>\n    </div></div>",
      "bgImage": "bg/bg-13.jpg",
      "bgScrim": "rgba(10,14,8,0.42)",
      "swipe": false
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<div style=\"position:relative;\">\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:38px 40px;margin-top:30px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#03402F;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Förklaring 2/2</div>\n      \n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:26px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"width:300px;height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 262 262\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"42.7,81.0 114.4,35.4 219.3,66.6 147.6,112.2\" fill=\"#dad5c7\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"147.6,226.6 147.6,112.2 219.3,66.6 219.3,181.0\" fill=\"#6c6962\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"42.7,195.4 42.7,81.0 147.6,112.2 147.6,226.6\" fill=\"#b1ada1\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"168.8,85.0 120.0,90.6 73.8,76.9 116.9,49.5 163.0,63.2\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"122.4,125.3 122.4,198.5 61.6,143.8\" fill=\"#15140f\"/></svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Tärning 1 (vriden)</div>\n    </div><div style=\"width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;background:#D0184D;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:44px;font-weight:900;\">✗</div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"width:300px;height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 262 262\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"42.7,81.0 114.4,35.4 219.3,66.6 147.6,112.2\" fill=\"#dad5c7\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"147.6,226.6 147.6,112.2 219.3,66.6 219.3,181.0\" fill=\"#6c6962\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"42.7,195.4 42.7,81.0 147.6,112.2 147.6,226.6\" fill=\"#b1ada1\" stroke=\"#15140f\" stroke-width=\"3.1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"168.8,85.0 120.0,90.6 73.8,76.9 116.9,49.5 163.0,63.2\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"61.6,114.1 128.7,134.0 95.1,190.4\" fill=\"#15140f\"/><polygon points=\"206.4,170.9 160.5,200.1 160.5,184.1 177.7,173.1 177.7,111.4 189.2,104.1 189.2,165.8 206.4,154.9\" fill=\"#15140f\"/></svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\">Tärning 2</div>\n    </div></div>\n      \n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin:22px 0 26px;\">\n      <span style=\"width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.25);\"></span><span style=\"width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:#056B50;\"></span>\n    </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:600;color:#D0184D;text-align:center;line-height:1.4;\">Tärningarna visar exakt samma symboler. Men titta på en triangel som syns i båda bilderna: den är vänd åt olika håll. Hur du än vrider tärningen går just den symbolen aldrig att få att peka likadant, så svaret är Olika.</div>\n    </div></div>",
